    cuda_packed_aggregate_alignment_missing_2026_11_14, 0, "Source audit only: packed small:u8@0 wide:u64@1 has TypeLayout size9 align1 but CUDA natural alignment8 yields size16; MirTypeDef lacks aggregate alignment. Runtime UNRUN."

