bug_investigation_logs |bug_id, line_num, content|
    cuda_packed_aggregate_alignment_missing_2026_11_14, 0, "2026-11-26 NVIDIA GB10 (aarch64, cc 12.1, driver 580.173.02), seed /home/yoon/.cache/cargo-target-wr-seed1126b/release/simple. Probe: hand-written PTX st.global.u64 [base+1] -> launch 0, sync 716 CUDA_ERROR_MISALIGNED_ADDRESS, so packed wide fields cannot use scalar access; explicit rejection is the fix (no byte-wise lowering exists)."
    cuda_packed_aggregate_alignment_missing_2026_11_14, 1, "Red at origin 79445b063c4: packed Packed(small,wide) lowered by the real MirLowering (size9 align1 wide@1) compiled in BOTH backends and a GEP+bitcast first-byte kernel wrote at CUDA stride 16 vs host stride 9: 61 device mismatches (cuda_packed_aggregate_live_spec and cuda_packed_aggregate_legacy_live_spec)."
    cuda_packed_aggregate_alignment_missing_2026_11_14, 2, "Fix: MirTypeDef.alignment transports TypeLayout.align from lower_struct_type/lower_class_type (0 = not transported at enum, loop-shape projection; vhdl catalog copies it); cuda_struct_admitted in both CUDA backends rejects alignment != CUDA natural (packed or over-aligned) from cuda_type_size and field_layout. Green: both live specs 3/3, Plain control 0 device mismatches. Residual: MIR rebuilt from the loop-shape projection or an SMF runtime_std frame carries alignment 0 and falls back to natural; identity text and SMF frame unchanged."
    cuda_packed_aggregate_alignment_missing_2026_11_14, 3, "Review follow-up: admission no longer depends on the carried alignment. A typedef rebuilt with alignment 0 (loop_module_shape_projection_v1.spl:306) was admitted and ran on the GB10 at stride 16 instead of 9 (61 mismatches). Both backends now reject any field whose offset is not a multiple of its CUDA alignment, after the extent-overflow check. Over-aligned producers (Outer align 8) use the producer stride and run with 0 mismatches. Rebased on work/bug-mir-field-offset-20261126; gated specs 5/5 per backend, intensive spec 33/38 (same 5 as the base). Residual: a packed aggregate whose fields are all naturally aligned and whose alignment was dropped to 0 (e.g. {u64,u8}) is still sized at the natural stride."

